+---
+id: task-003-long-stay-discount-for-rentals-of-3-days-or-more
+type: task
+title: "Long-stay discount for rentals of 3 days or more"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Long-stay discount for rentals of 3 days or more
+
+The desk wants to reward customers who stay longer. A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its
+full price. Quotes and bookings both show the reduced total.
+
+## Scope
+
+- `quote` and `book` on the rental service apply the discount: when a period is 3 whole days or longer,
+  the total is the full price (whole days times `dailyPrice`) reduced by 10%.
+- A period of fewer than 3 days is priced at the full price, as before.
+- The discounted total is an integer number of euro cents. The full price is multiplied by 90 and divided
+  by 100, rounded to the nearest cent, with halves rounded up.
+- `book` returns the discounted total, and `quote` returns the same total for the same period.
+- `availability` is unchanged.
+- The discount applies to the period as a whole, not per day.
+
+## Rules
+
+Those of task-001 apply. Money is integer cents, times are UTC midnights, and a booking covers whole days.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- AC1: a period of exactly 2 days is priced at the full price: 2 times `dailyPrice`.
+- AC2: a period of exactly 3 days costs 90% of 3 times `dailyPrice`; for a daily price of 2500, the total
+  is 6750.
+- AC3: a period longer than 3 days gets the same 10% reduction; for a daily price of 1999 over 4 days, the
+  full price is 7996 and the total is 7196.
+- AC4: a discounted total that is not a whole number of cents is rounded to the nearest cent, halves up:
+  for a daily price of 1999 over 3 days, the full price is 5997 and the total is 5397 (5397.3 rounds down).
+- AC5: `quote` and `book` for the same item and period return the same total.
+- AC6: the discount does not change which periods are accepted: the rules of task-001 still reject the same
+  invalid periods.
+
+## Traceability
+
+Changes the pricing of task-001 (AC1 applies to periods under 3 days only). Each acceptance criterion maps
+to one or more tests in `src/rental.test.ts`.
